cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TimelineXray, please cite it together with the upstream commit you pinned."
title: "TimelineXray"
abstract: >-
  Evidence-first research tool for the public xai-org/x-algorithm repository:
  commit-pinned snapshots, exact source spans with SHA-256 hashes, a native code index,
  a hash-chained findings ledger that marks changed evidence STALE, change digests and a
  read-only MCP server. Independent community analysis of publicly available source code.
  Not affiliated with or endorsed by X or xAI.
type: software
authors:
  - alias: "solisolsoli"
version: "0.10.0"
date-released: "2026-10-02"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/solisolsoli/timelinexray"
keywords:
  - x-algorithm
  - recommender systems
  - provenance
  - model context protocol
  - code search
